{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TARTAN FINDER (SCOTKILT)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Full tartan library browser shown directly on a page (search, filters, A–Z, grid/list, preview). It uses the same data
and script as the product Tartan picker. "Shop in this tartan" link blocks open a product or collection with
?tartan=handle, which the product Tartan picker uses to preselect the tartan.

URL parameters on the page itself:
- ?q=macdonald   prefill the search
- ?tartan=handle open that tartan's preview

Documentation: docs/TARTAN-PICKER.md
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  PORT NOTE (Horizon): everything below the wrapper is verbatim from the source
  theme. Only the wrapper is adapted, because the original one is Prestige-only:

  - `color_scheme` / `.color-scheme--*`  ->  `background_color` + `contrast-override`
    (Horizon has no colour schemes; see snippets/contrast-override.liquid)
  - `.section-spacing` / `.container--<size>` / `.section-stack`  ->  `.section section--<width>`
  - `{% render 'section-header' %}`  ->  inline heading markup (no such snippet in Horizon)

  The matching schema settings were swapped the same way. Nothing was removed.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign section_width = section.settings.section_width | default: 'page-width'
-%}

{{- 'tartan-picker.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag -}}
<script src="{{ 'tartan-picker.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{%- render 'xx-tartan-theme-vars' -%}
{%- render 'contrast-override',
  background_color: section.settings.background_color,
  section_id: section.id
-%}

<div
  class="section section--{{ section_width }} color-custom-{{ section.id }} tartan-finder-section"
  {% if section.settings.separate_section_with_border %}
    style="border-block-start: var(--style-border-width) solid var(--color-border);"
  {% endif %}
>
  {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank
      or section.settings.title != blank
      or section.settings.content != blank
  -%}
    <div class="tartan-finder-section__header">
      {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
        <p class="tartan-finder-section__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
        <h2 class="tartan-finder-section__heading">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.content != blank -%}
        <div class="tartan-finder-section__content">{{ section.settings.content }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- render 'tartan-finder-app', section: section -%}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .tartan-finder-section {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--gap-2xl);
    padding-block: var(--padding-5xl);
  }

  .tartan-finder-section__header {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--gap-xs);
  }

  .tartan-finder-section__subheading {
    font-size: var(--font-size--sm);
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }

  .tartan-finder-section__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-h2--family);
    font-size: var(--font-size--h2);
    font-weight: var(--font-h2--weight);
    line-height: var(--font-h2--line-height);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tartan-finder-section__content {
    max-width: var(--max-width--body-normal);
    color: var(--color-foreground-subdued);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

